:Class Server
⍝ APL Othello on the web: serves the browser client from a folder and plays a game in each browser that connects,
⍝ every game in this process, each in its own thread. Each instance has its own Conga root, so several can run at once.
⍝   s←⎕NEW Server(port folder app rl)   port 0 picks a free port; app has Run (ui/App.apln); rl supplies the enums (raylibAPL)
⍝   s.Start ⋄ … ⋄ s.Stop                faults leave State 'failed' and a message in Error rather than stopping the interpreter
    ⎕IO←0

    :Field Public Port
    :Field Public Folder
    :Field Public MaxGames←8          ⍝ browsers beyond this are told the server is busy
    :Field Public State←'stopped'     ⍝ stopped, running or failed
    :Field Public Error←''
    :Field Public Games←⍬             ⍝ Remote instances, one per browser

    :Field app
    :Field rl
    :Field lib
    :Field srv←''
    :Field conns←⍬                    ⍝ Conga connection names of Games
    :Field threads←⍬                  ⍝ threads playing Games, and some that have finished
    :Field loop←¯1
    :Field stop←0

    types←↑('.html' 'text/html; charset=utf-8')('.js' 'text/javascript')('.wasm' 'application/wasm')('.css' 'text/css')('.png' 'image/png')('.ico' 'image/x-icon')

    ∇ Make(p f a r)
      :Access Public
      :Implements Constructor
      (Port Folder app rl)←p f a r
      Folder,←'/'↓⍨'/'=⊃⌽Folder
      :If 9≠#.⎕NC'Conga' ⋄ 'Conga'#.⎕CY'conga' ⋄ :EndIf
      lib←#.Conga.New''                           ⍝ this instance's own Conga root
    ∇

    ∇ Start;rc;r
      :Access Public
      →('running'≡State)⍴0
      stop←0 ⋄ Error←''
      (rc srv)←2↑r←lib.Srv'' ''Port'http'('Options'(lib.Options.(DecodeHttp+WSAutoUpgrade)))
      :If 0≠rc ⋄ Fail'Cannot listen on port ',(⍕Port),': ',⍕r ⋄ →0 ⋄ :EndIf
      Port←⊃⌽1⊃lib.GetProp srv'LocalAddr'      ⍝ 0 (family address ip port)
      State←'running'
      loop←Loop&0
    ∇

    ∇ Stop
      :Access Public
      →(srv≡'')⍴0                                 ⍝ never started
      stop←1 ⋄ ⎕TSYNC loop~⎕TID
      :If 0<≢Games ⋄ Games.Disconnect ⋄ :EndIf
      ⎕TSYNC threads∩⎕TNUMS~⎕TID
      {}lib.Close srv
      State←'stopped'
    ∇

    ∇ Fail msg
      State←'failed' ⋄ Error←msg
      {}lib.Close srv
    ∇

    ∇ Loop x;rc;obj;evt;data
      :Trap 0
          :While ~stop
              (rc obj evt data)←4↑lib.Wait srv 250
              :Select evt
              :CaseList 'Timeout' 'Connect'
              :Case 'HTTPHeader' ⋄ Serve obj data
              :Case 'WSUpgrade' ⋄ Open obj
              :Case 'WSReceive' ⋄ Receive obj data
              :Else
                  :If (⊂obj)∊conns ⋄ Close obj                ⍝ the browser has gone
                  :ElseIf (srv≡obj)∧evt≡'Closed' ⋄ Fail'Server closed: ',⍕rc data ⋄ :Return
                  :Else ⋄ ⎕←'Server: ignored ',⍕rc obj evt
                  :EndIf
              :EndSelect
          :EndWhile
      :Else
          Fail⊃⎕DMX.DM
      :EndTrap
    ∇

    ∇ Serve(obj data);path;name;ext;i;body;head;n;t
    ⍝ answer an HTTP request with a file directly in Folder
      path←{⍵↑⍨⍵⍳'?'}1⊃data
      name←{0=≢⍵:'index.html' ⋄ ⍵}1↓path
      (n t)←0 1(⎕NINFO⍠1)Folder,'*'
      :If ('GET'≢0⊃data)∨~(⊂name)∊{∊1↓⎕NPARTS ⍵}¨n/⍨t=2
          head←'404 Not Found' 'text/plain' ⋄ body←⎕UCS'not found'
      :Else
          ext←2⊃⎕NPARTS name ⋄ i←types[;0]⍳⊂ext
          head←'200 OK'(i⊃types[;1],⊂'application/octet-stream')
          body←256|⎕NREAD(t←(Folder,name)⎕NTIE 0)83 ¯1 ⋄ ⎕NUNTIE t
      :EndIf
      head←'HTTP/1.1 ',(0⊃head),CRLF,'Content-Type: ',(1⊃head),CRLF,'Content-Length: ',(⍕≢body),CRLF,'Cache-Control: no-cache',CRLF,'Connection: close',CRLF,CRLF
      {}lib.Send obj((⎕UCS head),body)1
    ∇
    CRLF←⎕UCS 13 10

    ∇ Open obj;r
    ⍝ a browser has opened a WebSocket: play a game with it
      :If MaxGames≤≢Games
          {}lib.Send obj('W 800 800 APL Othello' 1)
          {}lib.Send obj((∊'F' 'C 28 32 38 255' 'T 250 380 30 226 229 233 255 Server busy, try later',¨⎕UCS 10)1)
          {}lib.Send obj('Q' 1)1 ⋄ →0
      :EndIf
      r←⎕NEW #.Remote(lib obj rl)
      Games,←r ⋄ conns,←⊂obj
      threads←(threads∩⎕TNUMS),Play&r
    ∇

    ∇ Receive(obj data);i
      i←conns⍳⊂obj ⋄ →(i=≢conns)⍴0
      (i⊃Games).Receive 2↑data
    ∇

    ∇ Play r;obj
    ⍝ thread: one game, until the browser closes it or goes. Closing the window closes the connection.
      obj←(Games⍳r)⊃conns,⊂''
      :Trap 0 ⋄ app.Run r ⋄ Drop obj
      :Else ⋄ ⎕←'game failed: ',⊃⎕DMX.DM ⋄ Close obj
      :EndTrap
    ∇

    ∇ Drop obj;i
    ⍝ forget a game
      i←conns⍳⊂obj ⋄ →(i=≢conns)⍴0
      (i⊃Games).Disconnect
      (Games conns)←(Games conns)/⍨¨⊂i≠⍳≢conns
    ∇

    ∇ Close obj
    ⍝ forget a game and close its connection
      Drop obj ⋄ {}lib.Close obj
    ∇

:EndClass
